OL,3,A'Come all the way' back to EU, French
OL,4,Afinance minister tells UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrench finance minister Roland Lescure
OL,7,Fhas invited Britain to "come all the
OL,8,Fway" back to the EU, after Prime
OL,9,FMinister Andy Burnham signalled a
OL,10,Fsecond Brexit referendum was "possible"
OL,11,Fin a future Labour election manifesto.
OL,13,FLescure said being in the bloc comes
OL,14,Fwith some difficulties, but it enables
OL,15,Fmembers to better address the
OL,16,Fchallenges facing the world.
OL,18,FLast week, Burnham said the UK needed
OL,19,Fto "consider the options", ranging from
OL,20,Fstaying as is, rejoining the customs
OL,21,Funion or single market, or going "all
OL,22,Fthe way".
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,0,100
